"program_narrative": "Program RTNCDE00 is a standard return-code handler subprogram. The caller passes RC-REQUEST-AREA, which holds the RETURN-CODE-AREA record of copybook RTNCODE, and the program returns with GOBACK. The request type selects one function: 'I' initialises the codes area (current and highest code 0, status success, response 0); 'S' records a new code, keeps the highest code seen, and classifies the code as success (0), warning (1-4), error (5-8) or severe (any other value); 'G' copies the current code, highest code and status to the return data; 'L' inserts a row with the current timestamp, program ID, codes, status and message into DB2 table RTNCODES; 'A' selects the count, maximum and minimum return code from RTNCODES for the program between a start and end time. Both SQL functions set response code 0 when SQLCODE is 0 and 8 otherwise; the other functions set response code 0. An unrecognised request type does nothing. All calls to the five function paragraphs use PERFORM ... THRU an EXIT-only paragraph.",
"paragraphs": [
  {
    "name": "(UNNAMED)", "paragraph_id": "SYS-PORTFOLIO-001-FIL-0052-PAR-0001", "section": null, "section_id": null, "line_range": [33, 52],
    "pseudocode": [
      "-- Entry: caller passes return_code_request (RC-REQUEST-AREA = RETURN-CODE-AREA from copybook RTNCODE) (PROCEDURE DIVISION USING, line 32)",
      "IF request_type = 'I' (RC-INITIALIZE) THEN",
      "  CALL p100-init-return-codes THRU p100-exit  !! PERFORM THRU: runs P100-INIT-RETURN-CODES then P100-EXIT",
      "ELSE IF request_type = 'S' (RC-SET-CODE) THEN",
      "  CALL p200-set-return-code THRU p200-exit  !! PERFORM THRU",
      "ELSE IF request_type = 'G' (RC-GET-CODE) THEN",
      "  CALL p300-get-return-code THRU p300-exit  !! PERFORM THRU",
      "ELSE IF request_type = 'L' (RC-LOG-CODE) THEN",
      "  CALL p400-log-return-code THRU p400-exit  !! PERFORM THRU",
      "ELSE IF request_type = 'A' (RC-ANALYZE) THEN",
      "  CALL p500-analyze-codes THRU p500-exit  !! PERFORM THRU",
      "END IF  -- no WHEN OTHER: an unknown request type does nothing",
      "RETURN to caller  -- GOBACK"
    ],
